<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-McCormick long-term raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-McCormick long-term raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised the long-term rating on McCormick and Co Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said the near-term rating remained accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1998 earnings estimate to a range of $1.45 to $1.50 a share, with emphasis on the high end. The previous estimate was $1.45 a share.</p>
<p>-- set an 18-month price target of about $30 a share.</p>
<p>-- said McCormick management has become more disciplined and the company is better able to grow its marketshare.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
